  | `components.<component>.certificate.*` | – | falls back to `zowe.certificate.*` per entry | certificate section | Component certificate override. |
  | `haInstances.<ha-instance>.components.<component>.*` | – | falls back to `components.<component>.*` | any | HA-instance override. |
