- **Endpoints:** `POST /gateway/api/v1/auth/refresh` – token as cookie `apimlAuthenticationToken` or Bearer; responses `204` + `Set-Cookie` / `401` token missing/invalid/expired / `403` client certificate missing or expired / `404` endpoint not enabled or not properly configured / `405` / `500` refresh failed
