- **Summary:** Recommended integration. With a Zowe JWT, Gateway passes it through without additional processing; with a client certificate, the certificate is transformed into a Zowe JWT and the downstream service authenticates. Optionally a custom HTTP header carrying the JWT can be configured in the Gateway and is added to each downstream request.
