- **Component(s):** Common/global (zowe.*), all API ML components
- **Summary:** API ML runs under the main Zowe STC user `ZWESVUSR`, which needs an OMVS segment. ZIS runs under `ZWESIUSR`. Both belong to group `ZWEADMIN`, which also needs an OMVS segment. `ZWESLSTC` must be associated with `ZWESVUSR`/`ZWEADMIN`. `ZWESECUR` or `zwe init security` creates all of this. The names can be changed through `zowe.setup.security.*`.
- **Enable / use:** RACF: `ADDGROUP ZWEADMIN OMVS(AUTOGID)`. `ADDUSER ZWESVUSR NOPASSWORD DFLTGRP(ZWEADMIN) OMVS(HOME(/tmp) PROGRAM(/bin/sh) AUTOUID)`. `RDEFINE STARTED ZWESLSTC.* UACC(NONE) STDATA(USER(ZWESVUSR) GROUP(ZWEADMIN) PRIVILEGED(NO) TRUSTED(NO) TRACE(YES))`, then `SETROPTS REFRESH RACLIST(STARTED)`. ACF2: `INSERT STC.ZWESLSTC LOGONID(ZWESVUSR) GROUP(ZWEADMIN) STCID(ZWESLSTC)`. TSS: `TSS ADDTO(STC) PROCNAME(ZWESLSTC) ACID(ZWESVUSR)`.
- **Config options:**
  | Key | Alt form (env var / modulith key / property) | Default | Values / type | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `zowe.setup.security.product` | – | `RACF` | `RACF` \| `ACF2` \| `TSS` | ESM. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.groups.admin` | – | `ZWEADMIN` | group | Admin group. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.groups.stc` | – | `ZWEADMIN` | group | STC group. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.groups.sysProg` | – | `ZWEADMIN` | group | SysProg. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.users.zowe` | `ZWE_zowe_setup_security_users_zowe` | `ZWESVUSR` | user | Zowe/API ML STC user. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.users.zis` | – | `ZWESIUSR` | user | ZIS user. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.stcs.zowe` | – | `ZWESLSTC` | STC | Zowe STC. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.stcs.zis` | – | `ZWESISTC` | STC | ZIS STC. |
  | `zowe.setup.security.stcs.aux` | – | `ZWESASTC` | STC | ZIS AUX STC. |
- **SAF / security setup:** class `STARTED`, profile `ZWESLSTC.*`.
- **Constraints / notes:** Required for a stand-alone API ML install. If z/OSMF is used for authentication, end users must be in `IZUUSER` or `IZUADMIN`.
- **Sources:** docs/user-guide/configure-zos-system.md, docs/user-guide/assign-security-permissions-to-users.md, docs/appendix/zowe-yaml-configuration.md

### F228 · ZSS/ZIS prerequisites relevant to API ML mapping (ICSF, ZWES.IS, LISTUSER)

- **Category:** Authorization
- **Component(s):** Common/global (zowe.*), Gateway (via ZSS)
- **Summary:** When ZSS is enabled, which API ML certificate and identity mapping require, the security requirements table also lists ICSF setup, with `ZWESVUSR` READ on `CSFRNGL` in `CSFSERV` (other IDs include `CSF1TRD`, `CSF1TRC`, `CSF1SKE`, `CSF1SKD`). It also lists READ on `ZWES.IS` (FACILITY) for ZIS access and READ on `IRR.RADMIN.LISTUSER` (FACILITY) for OMVS segment lookup.
