- **Enable / use:** `TTLSKeyringParms ZoweKeyring { Keyring ZWEKRNG }` and `TTLSKeyringParms ZoweNoX509Keyring { Keyring ZoweAttlsKeyring }`; replace `ZWEKRNG` with your keyring.
