- **Component(s):** Gateway, Discovery Service
- **Summary:** Routing requires mutual trust: Domain-1 truststore must contain root (and intermediate) public CA certificates of all registered Domain(2-N) API MLs; Domain(2-N) truststores must contain Domain-1's (local) CA public certificate to accept routed requests.
- **SAF / security setup:** PKCS12: `keytool -import -file <ca.cer> -alias <alias> -keystore <truststore.p12>`. RACF: `RACDCERT ADD('<dsn>') ID(ZWESVUSR) WITHLABEL('<label>') TRUST`; `RACDCERT ID(ZWESVUSR) CONNECT(ID(ZWESVUSR) LABEL('<label>') RING(ZoweKeyring) USAGE(CERTAUTH))`; `SETROPTS RACLIST(DIGTCERT, DIGTRING) REFRESH`; verify `RACDCERT LISTRING(ZoweKeyring) ID(ZWESVUSR)`. ACF2: `SET PROFILE(USER) DIV(CERTDATA)`; `INSERT CERTAUTH.<id> DSNAME('<dsn>') LABEL(<label>) TRUST`; `F ACF2,REBUILD(USR),CLASS(P),DIVISION(CERTDATA)`; `SET PROFILE(USER) DIVISION(KEYRING)`; `CONNECT CERTDATA(CERTAUTH.<id>) LABEL(<label>) KEYRING(ZWESVUSR.ZOWERING) USAGE(CERTAUTH)`; `F ACF2,REBUILD(USR),CLASS(P),DIVISION(KEYRING)`. TSS: `TSS ADD(CERTAUTH) DCDS(<dsn>) DIGICERT(<id>) LABLCERT('<label>') TRUST`; `TSS ADD(ZWESVUSR) KEYRING(ZOWERING) RINGDATA(CERTAUTH,<id>) USAGE(CERTAUTH)`; verify `TSS LIST(ZWESVUSR) KEYRING(ZOWERING)`.
- **Sources:** docs/user-guide/api-mediation/api-mediation-multi-tenancy.md

