### F355 · SMF audit records for PAT creation

- **Category:** Observability (logging, WTO, SMF, health)
- **Component(s):** Gateway
- **Summary:** API ML can issue SMF type 83 (RACF), 230 (ACF2) or 231 (Top Secret) security audit records when a Personal Access Token is created. Some predefined record values are configurable.
- **Enable / use:** Grant the Gateway user READ on `IRR.RAUDITX` in `FACILITY` (via `ZWESECUR` JCL; manual steps for upgrades from v1.18 and lower); override parameters via `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_<PARAM>` in zowe.yaml and restart Zowe.
- **Config options:**
  | Key | Alt form (env var / modulith key / property) | Default | Values / type | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `rauditx.fmid` | `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_FMID` | `AZWE001` | string | FMID of product/component issuing the SMF record |
  | `rauditx.component` | n/d (pattern implies `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_COMPONENT`) | `ZOWE` | string | Name of product/component issuing the record |
  | `rauditx.subtype` | n/d (pattern implies `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_SUBTYPE`) | `2` | integer | SMF type 83 record subtype |
  | `rauditx.event` | n/d (pattern implies `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_EVENT`) | `2` | integer | Event code |
  | `rauditx.qualifier.success` | n/d (pattern implies `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_QUALIFIER_SUCCESS`) | `0` | integer 0-255 | Event code qualifier for success |
  | `rauditx.qualifier.failed` | n/d (pattern implies `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_QUALIFIER_FAILED`) | `1` | integer 0-255 | Event code qualifier for failure |
- **SAF / security setup:** `FACILITY` class, resource `IRR.RAUDITX`, `READ` for `ZWESVUSR` (user running `ZWESLSTC`). RACF: `RLIST FACILITY IRR.RAUDITX AUTHUSER`; `PERMIT IRR.RAUDITX CLASS(FACILITY) ACCESS(READ) ID(ZWESVUSR)`; `SETROPTS RACLIST(FACILITY) REFRESH`. TSS: `TSS WHOHAS IBMFAC(IRR.RAUDITX)`; `TSS PER(ZWESVUSR) IBMFAC(IRR.RAUDITX) ACCESS(READ)`. ACF2: `SET RESOURCE(FAC)`; `LIST LIKE(IRR-)`; `RECKEY IRR ADD(RAUDITX ROLE(&STCGRP.) SERVICE(READ) ALLOW)`; `F ACF2,REBUILD(FAC)`.
- **Constraints / notes:** ⚠ Only `zowe.environments.RAUDITX_FMID` is shown explicitly; doc says the same procedure "can be applied to any SMF record configurable parameters" but does not spell out the other env var names (implied names above are derived, not documented).
- **Sources:** docs/user-guide/api-mediation/api-mediation-smf.md; docs/user-guide/api-mediation/authenticating-with-personal-access-token.md

