### F398 · zowe.yaml key reference (API ML)

- **Category:** Deployment & topology
- **Component(s):** Common/global (zowe.*), Gateway, Discovery Service, API Catalog, Caching Service, ZAAS, API ML (single-service), z/OSMF integration, High availability
- **Summary:** A consolidated table of every zowe.yaml key that API ML consumes. It is built from the zowe.yaml appendix, which is the authoritative list, and adds keys found only in other assigned docs, each marked with its source in brackets. The appendix sections for `components.gateway`, `components.discovery`, `components.api-catalog` and `components.caching-service` describe the multi-service component layout.
- **Status / version:** The appendix has **no** `components.zaas.*` section and **no** `components.apiml.*` (single-service/modulith) section. ZAAS and API ML keys below come only from the network, storage, K8s and preflight docs. The assigned files give no single-service equivalents for the gateway/discovery/catalog/caching keys.
- **Enable / use:** Set keys in `zowe.yaml`, using dotted path = nested YAML. Values merge with `defaults.yaml`. Any `components.<c>.*` key can be overridden per HA instance under `haInstances.<id>.components.<c>.*`.
- **Config options:**
